  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meni-Nina Farmers Cassava Production, Aggregation and Value Addition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperative is constrained by limited working capital for purchasing raw materials and insufficient technical support to help its farming members improve cassava production. The main outcome of the project will be an increased capacity for MNFMC to process and market high-quality gari.</narrative>
